{"slug":"kh-l-l","ar":"خ ل ل","total":13,"core":"gap; friendship","forms":[{"ar":"خِلَٰل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":8,"gloss":"midst; friendship","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":91,"p":10,"ar":["أَوْ","تَكُونَ","لَكَ","جَنَّةٌ","مِّن","نَّخِيلٍ","وَعِنَبٍ","فَتُفَجِّرَ","ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرَ","خِلَـٰلَهَا","تَفْجِيرًا"],"en":"Or [until] you have a garden of palm tress and grapes and make rivers gush forth within them in force [and abundance]"}},{"ar":"خَلِيل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"close friend","word":null,"ex":{"s":25,"a":28,"p":6,"ar":["يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰ","لَيْتَنِى","لَمْ","أَتَّخِذْ","فُلَانًا","خَلِيلًا"],"en":"Oh, woe to me! I wish I had not taken that one as a friend"}},{"ar":"خُلَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"friendship","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":254,"p":16,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَنفِقُوا۟","مِمَّا","رَزَقْنَـٰكُم","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِىَ","يَوْمٌ","لَّا","بَيْعٌ","فِيهِ","وَلَا","خُلَّةٌ","وَلَا","شَفَـٰعَةٌ ۗ","وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","هُمُ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ"],"en":"O you who have believed, spend from that which We have provided for you before there comes a Day in which there is no exchange and no friendship and no intercession. And the disbelievers - they are the wrongdoers"}}],"surahs":[[17,3],[2,1],[4,1],[9,1],[14,1],[18,1],[24,1],[25,1],[27,1],[30,1],[43,1]]}